          %h3#the_superbrane_scan The super-brane scan
          %p
            If the worldvolume QFT of the fundamental branes (for instance the worldsheet 2d
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/CFT"} CFT
            of the string) is required to be a
            = succeed "," do
              %span.newWikiWord
                supersymmetric QFT
                %a{:href => "/nlab/new/supersymmetric+QFT"} ?
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Green-Schwarz+action+functional"} Green-Schwarz action functional
            is used only particular combinations of the dimension
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
                  %mi dim
                  %mi Σ
                  %mo =
                  %mi p
                  %mo +
                  %mn 1
                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} dim \Sigma = p + 1
            of the worldvolume and
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
                  %mi D
                  %mo =
                  %mi dim
                  %mi X
                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} D = dim X
            of
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/spacetime"} spacetime
            are possible.
          %p
            The corresponding table has been called the
            %strong
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/brane+scan"} brane scan
